Would check/report the exact error response first before assuming it is the same. A *transient* issue with Sol was reported four days ago [here](https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/issues/36133#issuecomment-4928484247) and [here](https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/issues/36133#issuecomment-4928852025). In my case, the problem disappeared on its own, likely due to a provider-side configuration fix on their API nodes. That issue was closed as being a duplicate of this later-filed one, even though it was not Luna-specific. Could be that the transient is still lurking.
